a8abab12a8bd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"雑な原理としては go.mod 見て全部のパッケージ列挙して、その中のInterface列挙して、あるの型にマッチするInterfaceを全部出すって感じですよね。","ts":"1617186083.311100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"niyW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32877bad-28cc-4d88-b34a-9dcd32ddefca","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"そうですね・・\ngopls のソースコードを雑に眺めて見てみたけどなさそうでした","ts":"1617185990.309100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q3VOi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ae02ef9-c4e1-44af-8ce1-1b30b5c83a08","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それは極論全部のパッケージみないとダメなやつでしょ…goplsになにかあるんかな?","ts":"1617185268.308900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WP3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0756916a-9662-481b-8f07-c1a48dd717d6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"特定のインターフェースを実装している型の一覧を見たいんですが、GOPATH モードで `$ godoc -analysis type` を実行する以外に何か良い方法ありませんか？","ts":"1617185178.308100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hNW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00a0530f-394b-4eb6-b1ae-e287daac8b20","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"お、気になる…","ts":"1617180840.307800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c759bb2-7868-4077-8b25-8e6311538417","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"kaoriya さんのアレっぽさ。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/jsnjack/grm\u003e","ts":"1617170713.307600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: jsnjack/grm","id":1,"title":"jsnjack/grm","title_link":"https://github.com/jsnjack/grm","text":"An experimental package manager for GitHub Releases - jsnjack/grm","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5493713?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588